      "promptEs": "preferir que + acción de otra persona",
      "questionEn": "How do you express a preference about what another person does?",
      "answerEn": "Use a form of preferir, then que, then a specially changed form of the other person's action.",
      "noteEn": "The form after que is called the subjunctive: it presents a wanted action rather than a stated fact. For an -ar verb, the ending changes to an -e-family form: hablas becomes hable, and dejas can become deje or dejara depending on the time and tone.",
